      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "GLENBURNS WATERS (4) finished third last start over 1720m at Young, beaten 3.5 metres. That was an improvement on the unplaced effort at Riverina Paceway the run before. Big chance if anywhere near her best. NIFTY AMBITION (3) after getting caught wide over the early running settled close to the pace then found the lead only to be claimed in the straight and finish third last start over 1770m at this track, that run on the back of a good third at this track the run before. Has the benefit of a good draw. Big chance if things go his way. SYENITE (2) is better than his last-start seventh over 1710m at Goulburn. would suggest. He won here three runs back and is worth considering. ROSES ARE BEST (7) is the next elect off a last-start win by 2.25 metres at Young over 1720m after she raced behind the leader at the bell.",
